WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.930
So, Jonathan, what do you think today's meeting is about?

2
00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:08.410
The email sounded important.

3
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:14.630
Well, I have heard people in the building talking about budget cuts.

4
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.570
Oh! Budget cuts?

5
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:22.070
Wait, who has been talking about budget cuts?

6
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.650
Mark in Accounting.

7
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.630
Mark in Accounting?

8
00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.430
That's one person.

9
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.650
That's not "people."

10
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.790
I know, but Mark knows everything that goes on at The Studio.

11
00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:35.670
That is true.

12
00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:38.970
But wait, look at us.

13
00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:40.510
We shouldn't gossip.

14
00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:42.630
That's how rumors start.

15
00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:47.050
We'll just go to the meeting and see what happens.

16
00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:48.510
You're right.

17
00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:51.170
No more talk about budget cuts.

18
00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:55.050
Budget cuts?

19
00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:56.610
Oh no!

20
00:00:56.460 --> 00:01:03.170
I just heard Anna and Jonathan talking about budget cuts.

21
00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:06.250
That must be what the meeting is about.

22
00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:10.310
When there are budget cuts, people lose their jobs.

23
00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:11.870
Not you.

24
00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:13.870
You're a good reporter.

25
00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:15.630
And it's not you.

26
00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:19.170
You've done a great job as a videographer.

27
00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:22.910
I can't go back to being a detective.

28
00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.490
Criminals scare me!

29
00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:28.310
And I can't go back to being a teacher!

30
00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:30.750
High school kids scare me!

31
00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:06.970
Penelope, have you heard the news?

32
00:02:06.820 --> 00:02:10.010
Today's meeting is about budget cuts.

33
00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:11.290
That's awful!

34
00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:13.550
What should I do?

35
00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:14.490
Update your résumé.

36
00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:17.310
I’ve already updated mine.

37
00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:19.530
I’ll see you at the meeting.
